{"reviewId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J", "review": {"abstract": "如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "把繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段构成了正弦曲线的波浪线，繁荣、衰退处于x轴上方，经济增速都是>0，增速max在繁荣与衰退的分界点，从衰退开始增速逐渐下降，直到衰退和萧条的分界点增速为0，萧条就是负增速逐渐变大的过程，直到负增速max到达萧条和回升的分界点，负增速max逐渐缩小到达0就是回升。文中康波的顶点、谷底有歧义，容易理解为正弦函数的波峰波谷，实际正弦函数的波峰是经济增速的波峰，不是经济增长的最大值。可以这样理解，繁荣、衰退经济都在不断增长向上，只是经济增速由0→max→0，而萧条、回升经济掉头向下，经济不断负增长，经济增速由0→-max→0。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "2032-2121", "createTime": 1768710157, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J", "userVid": 30061740, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 30061740, "name": "陈菜芽", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJr2oqxOA7zZpTM9kD4gB37xrvbjG1UuXLQ97cIsib2Fjj7Vkz8KvNJoSnD99qDgXYhsTXowfPDa0A/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 75, "likes": [{"userVid": 222433533, "name": "杨琴คิดถึง", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/47CicbLQOxtVXAZkibOeUxCRWgIdgZQILFu5IvhEH4SEjBKMzibuH1eQUEibsAtaIB2Uw01c42lbGhY/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "个人理解：\n经济增速（可以理解为加速度），繁荣和衰退的经济增速都大于0（加速度大于0），区别是前则增速逐渐扩大（加速度不断增大），后者是逐渐减小（加速度不断减小但仍大于0），但无论繁荣还是衰退对于经济（可以理解为速度）而言都是上升的（因为加速度大于0），所以在衰退结束时到达顶端（速度达到最大值）。萧条和回升同理，经济增速都为负（加速度小于0），所以经济下行（速度减小），在回升期结束时经济到达谷底（速度达到最小值）。换言之经济增速在繁荣期结束时到达最大值（加速度最大），在萧条结束时为最小值（加速度最小，或者说反向的加速度最大），衰退期和回升期都为0（加速度为0）。用斜率解释也🉑。", "reviewId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J", "commentId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J_c586809981_88dzVA07K", "userVid": 586809981, "createTime": 1775665080, "author": {"userVid": 586809981, "name": "龍🐉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/icKyvCa5HPibZvNs8908wA6vibxWvJKxxRS9j4QQ5tqTetgicN2I8OsbOKHK95Q57SJBb0PU8Xj8FicgnsFJoptiam8Q/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "龍🐉", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202305-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}}, {"content": "你说的增长率", "reviewId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J", "commentId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J_c900434207_86VQBzReA", "userVid": 900434207, "createTime": 1771136340, "author": {"userVid": 900434207, "name": "远方", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-VUoWb~axuBMb0~aPhlPGvfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "远方", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241202-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "那就是加速度", "reviewId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J", "commentId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J_c353090598_86BeERaHh", "userVid": 353090598, "createTime": 1769965571, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 353090598, "name": "loey", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Pcn60ktY0l9RoRbfgq8zGClWfYUBaYsM9LJFbE9EU8V9D7iaIemGdHjX4aZK8s4Xqjkkm4fPyRXr5w3icZnhswicQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-2-9-I-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}}, {"content": "可以用切线来比喻吗？增速就是单位时间内变化量，而正弦函数定点切线的斜率等于0，而在x轴那一点，切线的斜率最大，也就是单位时间的变化最大。", "reviewId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J", "commentId": "30061740_86f8jMk9J_c239932584_86rYnWrWz", "userVid": 239932584, "createTime": 1769439460, "author": {"userVid": 239932584, "name": "子橘", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/OUicWJdJoz3HJ0bq9GbaiajG8UnprHodQ7wlA5CwiaxBgvogm23hGiaD9ic7WBHlxibhyAuzItvsLdJNI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "子橘", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1790056747}